<title>CHINA: China 1996 antimony exports rise 22.5 percent.</title>
<headline>China 1996 antimony exports rise 22.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought antimony rose to 31,192 tonnes in 1996, up by 22.5 percent compared with a year ago, customs figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Antimony exports were 3,345 tonnes in December alone.</p>
<p>Exports of antimony were 25,464 tonnes in 1995.</p>
</text>
